### Improved Route (Full Security)
```javascript
// IMPROVED - SECURE CODE
app.get('/users', 
  validateRequest((req) => {
    const params = validateQueryParams(req.query);
    req.validatedQuery = params;
    return { error: null };
  }),
  asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {
